   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A layer's node keeps its folder pattern; its specials branch to the right, each described; studio/ and reports/ are special Jobs; the box under a node holds its definition and variants; the next layer steps down and right. Red = open; green ✎ = changed.",
